  "notes": [
    "Byline 'John \"Hunta.Waya\" Smith' uses the stock placeholder name John Smith, so the deck is credited as plain text to the handle Hunta.Waya with no player page. The handle resembles HuntaWarya (Brian Hunter), but they are not the same handle, so no link is made.",
    "No starting section was posted; the Objective and Prepared Defenses (listed under Interrupts) are taken as the starting cards. They count toward the 60.",
    "Bespin, Bespin Cloud City, Cloud City Downtown Plaza and Cloud City West Gallery dested to the Dark printings.",
    "Posted 'EPP Vader' dested Darth Vader With Lightsaber (Enhanced Premiere); 'Lt. Commander Arden' dested Lieutenant Commander Ardan; 'Talon Roll' dested Tallon Roll.",
    "Secret Plans, Oppressive Enforcement and There Is No Try were Effects in June 2001 (pre-Reflections III); There Is No Try and Oppressive Enforcement were posted as two separate cards, so they stay as the single printings."
  ],
